            "review_title": "Review at Bến Cá Seafood",
            "review_text": "IvyHo\n1 contribution\n0\nDinner\nNov 2022\nI was confusing with many choices in Da Nang to have seafoods and found out this hidden place. It was surprisingly good, foods was awesome with reasonable price. Having dinner with my whole family for 7 people and it is only for around 2.5M VND, the staffs and owners were really helpful and suggested their must-try dishes which make the order easy. I will highly recommend their salad, crabs and also fried fish with mango as it has quite unique taste\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 8, 2022\nThai Ho\ncảm ơn quý khách đã ủng hộ Bến Cá seafood ạ, rất mong được phục vụ quý khách vào một ngày không xa ạ\nWritten February 27, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
